# NOTE: XTB2 does not support SMD/CPCM in ORCA (see error below) - switched
# to ALPB, the solvation model native to the XTB family, using the same
# "dmf" solvent name (also listed under the ALPB column in the ORCA solvent
# table).
#
# Original error from Monomer_XTB2_SMD.inp:
#   WARNING: Found SMD or SMDSolvent or CPCM keyword with XTB calculation.
#            This is not implemented.
#     ===> : Please use ALPB, ddCOSMO or CPCMX instead
#     ===> : Skipping actual calculation

! XTB2 Opt ALPB(dmf)

* xyz 0 1
C    0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
O    0.000000    1.220000    0.000000
H   -0.953000   -0.550000    0.000000
N    1.169000   -0.675000    0.000000
C    1.169000   -2.125000    0.000000
C    2.425000    0.050000    0.000000
H    2.197000   -2.488000    0.000000
H    0.655000   -2.488000    0.890000
H    0.655000   -2.488000   -0.890000
H    3.253000   -0.659000    0.000000
H    2.482000    0.677000    0.891000
H    2.482000    0.677000   -0.891000
*
